    "Check-in already recorded: %@.": {
      "comment": "add-training-shortcuts-and-widgets: Answer of the morning check-in (Siri, Shortcuts, Control) when this light is already today's check-in: nothing new was recorded. %@ is the light: Green, Amber or Red.",
